{#
settings/_sender_pictures.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Which looked-up sender pictures this reader wants (#639): company logos
(BIMI), Libravatar/Gravatar, and website icons.

The same plain auto-submitting form as the images card beside it, one
two-segment switch per source. Contact photos and other plMail users'
pictures are not switches — they never leave the server — and the intro says
so, so nobody goes looking for them.

When the administrator has not allowed lookups the switches are still shown,
dimmed, under a line saying why nothing will happen: the reader's choice is
kept for when it does, and a card that vanished would leave them wondering
where the setting went.

Accepts:
  choices         map of kind value => bool, for 'bimi', 'hashed', 'website'
  lookupsEnabled  bool — whether the administrator allows lookups
#}
{% set segText = 'flex h-full items-center justify-center px-3 py-1.5 text-center text-[11px] leading-tight text-ink-muted
                  peer-checked:bg-accent peer-checked:text-accent-ink
                  peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-inset peer-focus-visible:ring-accent
                  transition-colors cursor-pointer' %}

<div class="px-4 py-3 space-y-3">

<p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint">{{ 'settings.sender_pictures.intro'|trans }}</p>

{% if not lookupsEnabled %}
    <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mr-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{ 'settings.sender_pictures.admin_off'|trans }}
    </p>
{% endif %}

<form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_sender_pictures_update') }}" data-controller="ui--auto-submit"
      class="space-y-3 {{ lookupsEnabled ? '' : 'opacity-60' }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-sender-pictures') }}">

    {% for kind in ['bimi', 'hashed', 'website'] %}
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <span class="min-w-0">
                <span class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">{{ ('settings.sender_pictures.' ~ kind)|trans }}</span>
                <span class="block text-[11px] text-ink-faint mt-0.5">{{ ('settings.sender_pictures.' ~ kind ~ '_hint')|trans }}</span>
            </span>

            <div class="grid grid-flow-col auto-cols-fr shrink-0 rounded-pane border border-line overflow-hidden"
                 role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ ('settings.sender_pictures.' ~ kind)|trans }}">
                {% for on in [true, false] %}
                    <label>
                        <input type="radio" name="{{ kind }}" class="peer sr-only"
                               value="{{ on ? '1' : '0' }}"
                               data-action="change->ui--auto-submit#submit"
                               {{ choices[kind] == on ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                        <span class="{{ segText }}">
                            {{ (on ? 'settings.images.on' : 'settings.images.off')|trans }}
                        </span>
                    </label>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    {% endfor %}
</form>

</div>
